{"id":"509b31e4f1aec845","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NatStructure.md","title":"NatStructure","display":"NatStructure","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"NatStructure","parameters":["F","R","D","I","J"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"NatStructure"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>D</span><span>I</span><span>J</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论模型与证明。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>D</code>、<code>I</code>、<code>J</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ NatStructure F R D I J)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ Omega D)\n  (and\n    (@ FunDom I F)\n    (and\n      (@ FunDom J R)\n      (and\n        (forall c (implies (in c F) (exists h (and (@ App I c h) (@ NatFunction c h)))))\n        (forall c (implies (in c R) (exists H (and (@ App J c H) (@ NatRelation c H)))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2fa14e4bd3447c97\" href=\"?note=2fa14e4bd3447c97\" title=\"ZFC_FunDom\">FunDom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6eba982cb1b22cb0\" href=\"?note=6eba982cb1b22cb0\" title=\"ZFC_NatFunction\">NatFunction</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1feaf29faedeb413\" href=\"?note=1feaf29faedeb413\" title=\"ZFC_NatRelation\">NatRelation</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ NatStructure F R D I J)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_NatFunction|NatFunction]]；[[ZFC_NatRelation|NatRelation]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FunDom","status":"resolved","id":"2fa14e4bd3447c97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_NatFunction|NatFunction]]；[[ZFC_NatRelation|NatRelation]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NatFunction","status":"resolved","id":"6eba982cb1b22cb0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_NatFunction|NatFunction]]；[[ZFC_NatRelation|NatRelation]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NatRelation","status":"resolved","id":"1feaf29faedeb413","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_NatFunction|NatFunction]]；[[ZFC_NatRelation|NatRelation]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Omega","status":"resolved","id":"3bcf6cd1d43a3007","anchor":